Z||000004||Shaft||12-03-2001||09:57 PM||||That was really disappointing. I hate the new T-bird. I feel the Car of the Year should be a car that starts a new trend, is ahead in technology, unique in it's class, and most importantly it must be accessable to the average person. <P>That said, I feel the award should have gone to either the WRX, For it's unique styling (although many hate it) it's awsome performance, it's price tag and it is starting a trend of AWD performance/rally compact cars. Or the New Altima because it's engine is miles ahead, it's new styling, it adds performance and excitement to the mid-size class, and it kicks the crap out of the Accord and Camry for the same price.||||reg||1
